    {
      "subId": "2204001",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ogura Mio",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220400101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220400101": {
            "id": "220400101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "This is no way to continue doing business...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400102"
            ]
          },
          "220400102": {
            "id": "220400102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is something the matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400103"
            ]
          },
          "220400103": {
            "id": "220400103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "Ah, I'm sorry. I was just a little lost in my own thoughts. Are you here to buy some clothes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400104"
            ]
          },
          "220400104": {
            "id": "220400104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "The high-class silks from Liyue remain out of stock, but we still have the latest kimonos.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400105"
            ]
          },
          "220400105": {
            "id": "220400105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You used to import material from Liyue?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400106"
            ]
          },
          "220400106": {
            "id": "220400106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "Yes. Before, we were often able to secure high-end silk from Liyue such as those that the Feiyun Commerce Guild makes from Silk Flowers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400107"
            ]
          },
          "220400107": {
            "id": "220400107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "But with the current situation here, we haven't been able to import that sort of silk in a while now. We've been having to rely on our existing stock to continue operations.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400108"
            ]
          },
          "220400108": {
            "id": "220400108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "Every bolt of silk we use here is one we're not getting back...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400109"
            ]
          },
          "220400109": {
            "id": "220400109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "I originally planned to design some novel kimono patterns myself, or use some new dyes to make new cloth and attract customers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400110"
            ]
          },
          "220400110": {
            "id": "220400110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "But I can't think of anything that might be considered a \"novel\" pattern...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400111"
            ]
          },
          "220400111": {
            "id": "220400111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "Traveler, you've seen a lot, I'm sure. Have you encountered any designs that you might consider \"novel\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400112"
            ]
          },
          "220400112": {
            "id": "220400112",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I wouldn't say so, exactly...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400113"
            ]
          },
          "220400113": {
            "id": "220400113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "Ah, I see. Um, this might be rather presumptuous of me, but... could you help me ask other outlanders about patterns that we could use?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400114"
            ]
          },
          "220400114": {
            "id": "220400114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "I'm the only one running Ogura Textiles & Kimonos at the moment, so I can't leave the store. If I want to gather information, I can only ask others to do it for me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400115"
            ]
          },
          "220400115": {
            "id": "220400115",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Leave it to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400116"
            ]
          },
          "220400116": {
            "id": "220400116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "Great, let me think... You should go ask Miss Tang Wen and Mr. Ramsay. Perhaps they will have some new ideas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2204002",
      "subQuestName": "Ask Tang Wen about the kimonos",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220400301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220400301": {
            "id": "220400301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, do you have any ideas for kimono patterns?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400302"
            ]
          },
          "220400302": {
            "id": "220400302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Kimono patterns? I'm afraid I don't know anything about that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400303"
            ]
          },
          "220400303": {
            "id": "220400303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "But if you were to ask me... I think that books might look great as a design on a kimono.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400304"
            ]
          },
          "220400304": {
            "id": "220400304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Tang Wen",
            "text": "Hmm, books printed on kimonos... Now wouldn't that be interesting..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2204003",
      "subQuestName": "Ask Ramsay about the kimonos",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220400401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220400401": {
            "id": "220400401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, do you have any ideas for kimono patterns?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400402"
            ]
          },
          "220400402": {
            "id": "220400402",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ramsay",
            "text": "Kimono patterns? Haha, I'm not exactly an expert on that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400403"
            ]
          },
          "220400403": {
            "id": "220400403",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ramsay",
            "text": "But if I were to choose a design, I'd go with tea sets. Those would look neat on a kimono.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400404"
            ]
          },
          "220400404": {
            "id": "220400404",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ramsay",
            "text": "A kimono printed with a tea set design... Hahaha, now that certainly would have an Inazuman feel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2204004",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Ogura Mio",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220400501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220400501": {
            "id": "220400501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "So did you ask them about it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400502"
            ]
          },
          "220400502": {
            "id": "220400502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I did.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400503"
            ]
          },
          "220400503": {
            "id": "220400503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "Great! So what did they say?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400504"
            ]
          },
          "220400504": {
            "id": "220400504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "Books and... tea sets? That sounds interesting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400505"
            ]
          },
          "220400505": {
            "id": "220400505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "But how should we make them exactly? Hmm, I need to give this a bit more thought...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220400506"
            ]
          },
          "220400506": {
            "id": "220400506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ogura Mio",
            "text": "Thank you, Traveler. This information has proved extremely useful to me. Please, accept these as a token of my appreciation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
